:: dark_tut
\> You step through the door-

\> Pure black. You can't see a thing.

\> You feel for the door behind you, only to find a smooth stone wall behind you.

\> [[[...]|dark_tut2]]

:: dark_tut2






<<set $tutCrunch to 0>>
\> Okay. This is fine. You're fine! There's just no door where there was a door, and you're in a pitch black room. Textbook fine.

\> After a long moment, you feel around. The space is narrow enough that you can feel both sides with your arms out.

\>> [[[Start moving forwards.]|dark_tut_crunch]]

:: dark_tut_crunch







<<set $tutCrunch to $tutCrunch + 1>>
<<if $tutCrunch is 1>>
\> You hear something crunch under your feet. Nothing could possibly make you check what it is, but you take note.

\>> [[[Another.]|dark_tut_step]]
<<else>>

<</if>>

